(text
"Lock RM67162 version; module R4=0R, R3=NC, IM1 high for QSPI. VBAT=AM_RAW; VCC=2.8V; IOVCC=1.8V.\nTouch held in RESET; touch signals and TE unused. 18-core harness pin numbering must match vendor CN1.\nKeep screen and harness in floating system domain. Driver starts at 10MHz; refresh limited to status regions.\nDedicated SPI3 QSPI; ADC uses SPI2; microSD uses separate 1-bit SDMMC. Supplies, translation and inrush require bench tests."
